ively but not recklessly. A modest raise of 300-400 chips would build the pot while still allowing me to fold if they come back with significant aggression. However, checking here could be deceptive and might induce a bluff. Given the strength of my hand and that I need to recover chips, I'll make a moderate raise to extract value.\n\nAnswer: 300"}
