nt likely folds everything I beat and calls with what beats me\n- **Fold (-1):** Absurd with trips\n\nReason: I have three 3s, which is a strong hand on this board. My opponent has only called my bets without showing aggression, suggesting they don't have a Full House with sixes. A moderate bet of 400-600 chips extracts value from hands like smaller trips, two pairs, or even a bluff-catch with ace-high. Checking might miss value, while all-in risks only getting called by better hands. I'll bet 500 to build the pot while keeping risk manageable.\n\nAnswer: 500"}
